WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.769
Mrs. Rice: There, I hope they read my note.

2
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:19.803
Mrs. Rice: Now I should go warn Tina's parents.

3
00:00:19.804 --> 00:00:23.921
Mrs. Rice: I saw the giant at her house first.

4
00:00:23.922 --> 00:00:25.357
Mrs. Rice: What was that?

5
00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:35.035
There's something in the garage.

6
00:00:35.036 --> 00:00:36.988
Danny: That was loud.

7
00:00:36.989 --> 00:00:39.023
Brad: She's a clumsy cat.

8
00:00:39.024 --> 00:00:41.635
Tina: I love your cat anyway.

9
00:00:41.636 --> 00:00:45.111
Bello: We all do!

10
00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:49.848
Dave: Okay. It's time to get big again. What's next?

11
00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.667
Tina: Brad has to fix the shrink-gun.

12
00:00:52.668 --> 00:00:55.140
Danny: I already got the nano-putty.

13
00:00:55.141 --> 00:01:02.237
Chuck: Yeah, you got the nano-putty all over yourself.

14
00:01:02.238 --> 00:01:03.631
Danny: Here it is.

15
00:01:03.632 --> 00:01:07.216
Brad: Thanks.

16
00:01:07.217 --> 00:01:10.921
Dave: That doesn't look like it's going to work.

17
00:01:10.922 --> 00:01:12.978
Tina: You can fix it though.

18
00:01:12.979 --> 00:01:15.232
Can't you, Brad?

19
00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:17.349
Bello: Give it your best shot.

20
00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:21.005
Brad: Okay. I'll need a little more nano-putty.

21
00:01:21.006 --> 00:01:23.173
Danny: Here you go.

22
00:01:23.174 --> 00:01:28.662
Tina: You'll need this.

23
00:01:28.663 --> 00:01:30.572
Chuck: Will it work now?

24
00:01:30.573 --> 00:01:33.142
Brad: Not yet.

25
00:01:33.143 --> 00:01:35.795
Brad: I don't think this piece will work.

26
00:01:35.796 --> 00:01:38.232
I need a paper clip instead.

27
00:01:38.233 --> 00:01:40.080
Dave: Then will it work?

28
00:01:40.081 --> 00:01:44.243
Brad: Nope. It's going to need more power to make us all big again.

29
00:01:44.244 --> 00:01:46.804
Brad: We need to find some batteries.

30
00:01:46.805 --> 00:01:51.813
Tina: But where are we going to find a paper clip and batteries small enough?

31
00:01:51.814 --> 00:01:55.536
Danny: Well, I know where we can find a tiny paper clip.

32
00:01:55.537 --> 00:01:58.482
Bello: And I know where we can find some batteries.

33
00:01:58.483 --> 00:02:01.838
Brad: Okay, lead the way.

34
00:02:01.839 --> 00:02:07.190
Bello: They aren't far, but they are high.

35
00:02:07.191 --> 00:02:10.184
Brad: You mean they're on the table, up there?

36
00:02:10.185 --> 00:02:12.780
Danny: We'll never make it up there.

37
00:02:12.781 --> 00:02:14.529
Tina: I'll get up there.

38
00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:23.850
I have a plan.

39
00:02:23.851 --> 00:02:28.851
Tina: You four, bring the ruler over there, next to the shoe box.

40
00:02:28.852 --> 00:02:31.118
Tina: Brad, you come with me.

41
00:02:31.119 --> 00:02:36.273
Brad: What are we getting?

42
00:02:36.274 --> 00:02:37.361
Tina: This.

43
00:02:37.362 --> 00:02:44.661
Brad: Okay, let's roll it back.

44
00:02:44.662 --> 00:02:54.974
Tina: Okay, let's put the ruler on top of the spool of thread.

45
00:02:54.975 --> 00:02:59.537
Bello: A teeter-totter! How clever, Tina.

46
00:02:59.538 --> 00:03:01.868
Dave: It doesn't look very steady.

47
00:03:01.869 --> 00:03:08.174
Danny: Don't worry. I can fix that.

48
00:03:08.175 --> 00:03:12.460
Chuck: Are you sure you will be able to get up that high?

49
00:03:12.461 --> 00:03:19.735
Tina: If you five jump onto the ruler from up there, the other end [n3@will send me flying pretty high.

50
00:03:19.736 --> 00:03:22.459
Dave: It seems dangerous to me.

51
00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:25.944
Brad: Don't worry. Tina is great at gymnastics.

52
00:03:25.945 --> 00:03:31.070
Danny: Okay. Let's do it.

53
00:03:31.071 --> 00:03:33.994
Bello: Are you ready, Tina?

54
00:03:33.995 --> 00:03:36.917
Tina: Yup. Fire away.

55
00:03:36.918 --> 00:03:45.154
Bello & the boys: Geronimo!

56
00:03:45.155 --> 00:03:46.978
Chuck: She didn't make it!

57
00:03:46.979 --> 00:03:51.475
Dave: Tina, are you all right?
